/* ===== 动态格式化条目 ===== */
" %@ isn't connected right now, so tracking is using %@; the moment it's back, Pawvis returns to it." = " %@ 当前未连接，追踪正在使用 %@；它一回来 Pawvis 就切回去。";
" %@ isn't connected right now. Tracking uses the built-in camera until it's back." = " %@ 当前未连接。在它回来之前使用内建摄像头。";
"%@ (not connected)" = "%@（未连接）";
"%.1f s of holding still before the click fires. Shorter clicks sooner but fires more easily while you rest; longer is calmer but slower." = "保持静止 %.1f 秒后发出点击。更短则点击更快但休息时更容易误触发；更长则更稳但更慢。";
"Hand every spoken command to %@?" = "把每条语音指令都交给 %@？";
