/* ===== 欢迎导览 ===== */
"Welcome to Pawvis" = "欢迎使用 Pawvis";
"Pawvis turns your hand into the mouse. Three short steps and you're pointing." = "Pawvis 把你的手变成鼠标。三小步之后你就能指点屏幕。";
"Pawvis watches for your hand through the camera. Frames are processed in memory and discarded; nothing is recorded or uploaded." = "Pawvis 通过摄像头寻找你的手。画面在内存中处理后就丢弃，不录制也不上传。";
"The same frames show it your face: turn away and pointer, click and gesture actions pause until you look back (you can switch this off in Settings)." = "同样的画面也会看到你的脸：转开视线时，光标、点击和手势动作会暂停，直到你看回来（可在设置中关闭）。";
"Any camera macOS can see works, your iPhone included: when it's nearby as a Continuity Camera it appears in the picker." = "macOS 能看到的摄像头都可以用，包括 iPhone：作为连续互通相机在附近时，它会出现在选择器里。";
"Camera access was denied, so tracking can't run. Enable Pawvis under Privacy & Security → Camera." = "摄像头访问被拒绝，追踪无法运行。请在隐私与安全性 → 摄像头中启用 Pawvis。";
"Continue" = "继续";
"Open System Settings…" = "打开系统设置…";
"Clicks need Accessibility. Tracking works without it, but clicks won't land until it's granted." = "点击需要辅助功能权限。没有它追踪照常工作，但点击不会生效。";
"Grant Access" = "去授权";
"Two gestures do most of it" = "两个手势搞定大部分操作";
"Open hand takes control" = "张开的手接管控制";
"All four fingers up, and the cursor rides your palm. A brief fist parks it." = "四指向上，光标跟随你的手掌。短暂握拳即可停靠。";
"Dip your index finger to click" = "下压食指点击";
"Like tapping a mouse button. Keep the other fingers up; hold the dip to drag." = "像按鼠标键一样。其余手指向上；按住不放就是拖拽。";
"Everything else is in the Gesture Guide: right-click, scroll, drags, custom gestures." = "其余手势都在手势指南里：右键、滚动、拖拽、自定义手势。";
