"Nothing to practice with these settings." = "当前设置下没有可练习的内容。";
"That's the round." = "本轮完成。";
"Learn the moves" = "学习这些操作";
"The round teaches the mouse motions — pointing, clicking, dragging, scrolling — against live targets, with the tracker's view of your hand beside the board." = "练习用真实目标教你鼠标动作：指向、点击、拖拽、滚动，棋盘旁同步显示追踪器看到的手。";
"Pawvis turns your hand into the mouse. This two-minute round walks you through each motion against live targets, with the tracker's view of your hand alongside." = "Pawvis 把你的手变成鼠标。这轮两分钟的练习带你对着真实目标逐个练会每个动作，旁边同步显示追踪器看到的手。";
"No mouse motions to practice" = "没有可练习的鼠标动作";
"Change in Settings…" = "到设置中更改…";
"Tracking" = "追踪";
"The round needs the camera running: your hand is what moves the cursor onto the targets." = "练习需要摄像头运行：正是你的手把光标移到目标上。";
"Clicks need Accessibility. The claw will still move without it, but no click, drag or scroll will land — so the round waits here." = "点击需要辅助功能权限。没有它小爪照样移动，但点击、拖拽和滚动都不会生效，所以练习在这里等待。";
"Nothing in here changes your settings, and closing the window costs you nothing: the round can be run again and again from Settings → About." = "这里的任何操作都不会改动你的设置，随时关窗也没有损失：练习可以从设置 → 关于反复运行。";
"Skip for now" = "暂时跳过";
