"Move your hand and the claw follows your palm. Steer it onto each target and hold still for a beat to pop it." = "移动手，小爪跟随你的手掌。把它引到每个目标上，停稳片刻即可点亮。";
"Dip your index finger, like tapping a mouse button, with the other fingers up. Lift it quickly for a clean click." = "像按鼠标键一样下压食指，其余手指向上。快速抬起就是一次干净点击。";
"Dip your index finger on the token, keep it dipped while you move, and lift it over the slot." = "在棋子上下压食指，保持下压并移动，到槽位上方再抬起。";
"Fold your middle and ring fingers in, index and pinky up, then move your whole hand to scroll. Find the treat at the bottom." = "中指和无名指收拢，食指和小指向上，然后移动整只手滚动。找到底部的零食。";
