"Each of these can run an action of your choosing: switch desktops, snap windows, press shortcuts, open apps, run commands. A gesture without an action is ignored entirely." = "这些手势都可以运行你选的动作：切换桌面、贴靠窗口、按快捷键、打开应用、运行命令。未绑定动作的手势完全被忽略。";

/* ===== 精确 key 补齐（第四轮核对） ===== */
"Every gesture below can run an action of your choice: switch desktops, snap windows, press shortcuts, open apps, run commands. A gesture without an action is ignored entirely — assign one to switch it on. Tuning for each gesture sits collapsed in its own row." = "以下每个手势都能运行你选的动作：切换桌面、贴靠窗口、按快捷键、打开应用、运行命令。未绑定动作的手势完全被忽略——绑定一个即可启用。每个手势的微调折叠在各自行内。";
"Gestures you record yourself: Pawvis watches you perform one a few times, learns what stays the same, and matches it live. The badge replays the motion it learned — your palm and fingertips, in their tracking colors." = "你自己录制的手势：Pawvis 观看你表演几次，学习多次之间的共同点，然后实时匹配。徽章会用追踪色回放它学到的动作——你的手掌和指尖。";
"Matching keeps running through clicks and scrolls, and once a match is recognized and dwelling, finger dips can't click. A dip that lands before recognition can still click — give the gesture a hold time and the block covers the rest. Off: the mouse always wins." = "点击和滚动期间匹配照常进行；一旦识别到手势并处于保持期，手指下压不再点击。识别前落下的下压仍会点击——给手势设置保持时间即可覆盖其余情况。关闭时鼠标始终优先。";
"Direction changes each finger must make. Left: a brief flutter fires. Right: a longer, more emphatic wiggle. Shared by both wiggle gestures." = "每根手指需要改变方向的次数。左：轻轻一抖就触发。右：需要更长更用力的摆动。两种摆动手势共用。";
"The pose must dwell %.1f s before it fires. Shared by all held poses." = "姿势需保持 %.1f 秒后触发。所有保持类姿势共用。";
"How snugly your fingertips must bunch to count as a grab. Left: only a tight cluster. Right: a looser bunch counts — try moving this right if grabs won't register." = "指尖要聚多拢才算抓取。左：只有紧聚才算。右：松散聚拢也算——抓取识别不出来时向右调。";
"How far the grabbed bunch must travel. Left: a small tug fires. Right: a full fling. Both dials are shared by all grab & fling directions." = "聚拢的指尖要移动多远。左：轻拉即触发。右：需要完整的甩出。两个旋钮为全部抓取投掷方向共用。";
"When one of these apps is frontmost, its action fires instead of the one above. With the main action set to Not assigned, the gesture fires only in the apps listed here and does nothing anywhere else." = "这些应用处于前台时执行对应动作，而不是上面的主动作。主动作设为未绑定时，手势只在列出的应用里生效，其他地方不做任何事。";
"Export saves every trained gesture, with its assigned action, to a file you can back up or share. Import merges another file's gestures into yours as copies: a name already in use gets renumbered, and nothing here is ever overwritten." = "导出把所有训练的手势及其绑定的动作存为一个文件，可备份或分享。导入会把文件中的手势以副本形式并入：重名的会重新编号，绝不覆盖现有内容。";
"Import Trained Gestures" = "导入训练的手势";
"Left: only a performance very close to your takes counts. Right: looser matching — move this right if the gesture won't trigger, left if it triggers by accident." = "左：只有非常接近你录制的表演才算。右：更宽松——手势触发不出来时向右调，误触发时向左调。";
"Keep matching for %.1f s before it fires — the pill counts it down." = "持续匹配 %.1f 秒后才触发——胶囊会显示倒计时。";
"Fires the moment it matches. Raise this for pose-like gestures so a passing resemblance can't trigger." = "匹配即触发。姿势类手势请调高，避免偶然相似就触发。";
"This variant → what it's bound to" = "该变体 → 绑定的动作";
"→ what it does" = "→ 它做什么";
"Get ready… %d" = "准备……%d";
"Take saved. Record %d more so Pawvis can learn what stays the same." = "已保存这一遍。再录 %d 遍，让 Pawvis 学会其中的共同点。";
"Take %d disagrees with the rest — remove it, or record a few more." = "第 %d 遍与其余差别太大——移除它，或再录几遍。";
"My gesture %d" = "我的手势 %d";
"Show your hand%@ to the camera" = "把手伸给摄像头";
"s-hands-suffix" = "（双手）";
"Takes (%d of %d)" = "录制（%d / %d）";
"Selected camera" = "已选摄像头";
"(not connected)" = "（未连接）";
"yes, I understand" = "是，我已了解";
"The first-run walkthrough: what Pawvis does, the permissions it needs, and the two gestures that carry most of the work. A new install sees it automatically — this is how to find it again." = "首次运行的导览：Pawvis 是什么、需要哪些权限，以及承担主要工作的两个手势。全新安装会自动播放——这里是再次找到它的入口。";
"A two-minute practice round: take control, move, click, drag, scroll and right-click against live targets, with the tracker's live view of your hand telling you what it sees. It opens on its own once, right after the welcome tour." = "两分钟练习：对着真实目标完成接管、移动、点击、拖拽、滚动和右键，追踪器的实时画面会告诉你它看到了什么。练习会在欢迎导览后自动打开一次。";
"Pawvis operates this Mac. It moves the real cursor and posts real clicks, drags and scrolls on your behalf, so a stray gesture can click whatever is under the pointer. With voice control on it can also open apps, type and run commands: a misheard sentence is still a command." = "Pawvis 会操作这台 Mac。它替你移动真实光标并发出真实的点击、拖拽和滚动，一个走神的手势就可能点到光标下的任何东西。开启语音控制后它还能打开应用、输入和运行命令：听错的句子同样会被执行。";
"Pawvis is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Its developer accepts no liability for any action taken with it, intentional or not, or for any resulting loss or damage. You are responsible for what happens on your machine." = "Pawvis 按现状提供，不附带任何形式的保证。开发者对使用它产生的任何行为（无论是否有意）以及由此造成的任何损失不承担责任。你的机器上发生的一切由你负责。";
"While the theremin is on, hand tracking plays the instrument and never touches the mouse. Switch it off (or close this window) to point again. Recordings and exports never leave your Mac." = "特雷门琴开启期间，手部追踪只演奏乐器，完全不碰鼠标。关闭它（或关掉本窗口）即可恢复指向。录音和导出绝不会离开你的 Mac。";
"±%.0f cents at %.1f Hz." = "±%.0f 音分，%.1f Hz。";
"Off is the real instrument: every pitch in between the notes. A scale pulls the pitch toward its notes, which is how a theremin gets played in tune." = "关闭即真实乐器：音符之间每个音高都有。音阶会把音高拉向它的音符，特雷门琴正是这样演奏准音的。";
"%.0f ms. Left is direct; right slides between pitches like a slow portamento." = "%.0f 毫秒。左为直接；右为在音高之间滑动，像缓慢的滑音。";
"The right-most hand plays pitch, the other volume. With no volume hand the last level holds (full to begin with), so one hand can play alone." = "最靠右的手演奏音高，另一只控制音量。没有音量手时保持上一音量（开始为满音量），因此单手也能演奏。";
"A fist cuts the sound for staccato, something the real instrument can't do. Off by default so a misread fist can't cut a held note." = "握拳切断声音奏出断音，这是真实乐器做不到的。默认关闭，避免误读的拳切断持续音。";
"The round teaches the mouse motions — pointing, clicking, dragging, scrolling — against live targets, with the tracker's view of your hand alongside. It needs cursor control switched on." = "练习用真实目标教你鼠标动作：指向、点击、拖拽、滚动，旁边同步显示追踪器看到的手。需要开启光标控制。";
"Pawvis turns your hand into the mouse. This two-minute round walks you through each motion against live targets, and shows what the tracker sees the whole time. Skip any lesson, or the whole round, whenever you like." = "Pawvis 把你的手变成鼠标。这轮两分钟的练习带你对着真实目标逐个练会每个动作，并全程显示追踪器看到的画面。任何一课或整轮练习都可以随时跳过。";
"Mouse control is off: you chose “custom gestures only” under Settings → Tracking, so there is nothing to practice here." = "鼠标控制已关闭：你在设置 → 追踪里选择了“仅自定义手势”，这里没有可练习的内容。";
"Camera access was denied, so tracking can't run and there is nothing to practice with. Enable Pawvis under Privacy & Security → Camera." = "摄像头访问被拒绝，追踪无法运行，也没有可练习的内容。请在隐私与安全性 → 摄像头中启用 Pawvis。";
"Clicks need Accessibility. The claw will still move without it, but no click, drag or scroll will land — so the lessons after this one can't complete." = "点击需要辅助功能权限。没有它小爪照样移动，但点击、拖拽和滚动都不会生效，后面的课程也无法完成。";
"Nothing in here changes your settings, and closing the window costs you nothing: the round can be run again any time from Settings → Mouse or Settings → About." = "这里的任何操作都不会改动你的设置，随时关窗也没有损失：练习可以从设置 → 鼠标或设置 → 关于反复运行。";
"Show the camera an open hand: all four fingers up, thumb free. The claw brightens when Pawvis hands you the cursor; a brief fist parks it again." = "向摄像头亮出张开的手：四指向上，拇指放松。Pawvis 交出光标时小爪会变亮；短暂握拳即可再次停靠。";
"Fold your middle and ring fingers in, index and pinky up, then move your whole hand to scroll. Find the treat at the bottom of the strip, then scroll back to the top." = "中指和无名指收拢，食指和小指向上，然后移动整只手滚动。找到条带底部的零食，再滚回顶部。";
"Open Settings…" = "打开系统设置…";
"The camera isn't showing an image (it looks black). If it's your iPhone, point its rear lens at you — Continuity Camera uses the back camera. Otherwise check for a lens cover or a dark room, or pick another camera." = "摄像头没有画面（看起来是黑的）。如果是 iPhone，请把后置镜头对准你——连续互通相机用的是背面摄像头。否则请检查镜头盖或环境过暗，或另选摄像头。";
"Pawvis watches for your hand through the camera. Frames are processed in memory and discarded; nothing is recorded and nothing leaves your Mac." = "Pawvis 通过摄像头寻找你的手。画面在内存中处理后就丢弃，不录制任何内容，也不会离开你的 Mac。";
"The same frames show it your face: turn away and pointer, click and gesture actions pause until you look back — brief glances cost nothing, and voice control works with your back turned. It starts on; the switch is in Settings → Tracking." = "同样的画面也会看到你的脸：转开视线时，光标、点击和手势动作会暂停，直到你看回来——短暂瞥视没有影响，背对屏幕时语音控制照常工作。默认开启，开关在设置 → 追踪。";
"Any camera macOS can see works, your iPhone included: when it's nearby as a Continuity Camera it appears in the picker in Settings → General, one pick away. It uses the iPhone's rear lenses, so point the back of the phone at you." = "macOS 能看到的摄像头都可以用，包括 iPhone：作为连续互通相机在附近时，它会出现在设置 → 通用的选择器里，一键即选。它使用 iPhone 的后置镜头，请把手机背面对准你。";
"Next comes a two-minute practice round that teaches the moves against live targets; skip it any time. Pawvis lives in the menu bar: click the claw to stop or start tracking, or open Settings, where this tour and the practice round live." = "接下来是一轮两分钟的练习，对着真实目标学会这些操作，可随时跳过。Pawvis 常驻菜单栏：点小爪可停止或开始追踪，或打开设置——导览和练习都从那里进入。";
"Notifications are off for Pawvis, so new versions won't announce themselves — you'll still see them here and in the menu bar." = "Pawvis 的通知已关闭，新版本不会主动提醒——你仍会在这里和菜单栏看到它们。";
"The update is installed and starts when Pawvis relaunches." = "更新已安装，Pawvis 重启后生效。";
"Install and Relaunch" = "安装并重启";
"Skip This Version" = "跳过此版本";
"Release Notes" = "发行说明";
"Not checked yet" = "尚未检查";
"Pawvis is up to date" = "Pawvis 已是最新版本";
"the treat is down here" = "零食在这里下面";
"back to the top" = "回到顶部";
"Animation: a hand opens and the claw cursor lights up." = "动画：一只手张开，小爪光标亮起。";
"Animation: the claw glides from target to target." = "动画：小爪在目标之间滑行。";
"Animation: the ring tightens, the claw closes purple, and the button flashes." = "动画：圆环收紧，小爪闭合成紫色，按钮闪烁。";
"Animation: the claw closes on a token and carries it into its slot." = "动画：小爪闭合抓住棋子并送入槽位。";
"Animation: the claw parks inside a blue ring" = "动画：小爪停靠在蓝色圆环内";
" while the list scrolls down and back up." = "，同时列表向下滚动再回到顶部。";
" and a menu pops open." = "，菜单弹出。";

/* ===== 精确 key 终版 ===== */
"Every gesture below can run an action of your choice: switch desktops, snap windows, press shortcuts, open apps, run commands. A gesture without an action is ignored entirely — assign one to switch it on. Tuning for each lives in its row." = "以下每个手势都能运行你选的动作：切换桌面、贴靠窗口、按快捷键、打开应用、运行命令。未绑定动作的手势完全被忽略——绑定一个即可启用。每个手势的微调就在它自己的行内。";
"Matching keeps running through clicks and scrolls, and once a match is recognized and dwelling, finger dips can't click. A dip that lands before recognition can still click — give the gesture a hold time and the block covers the rest. Off: the mouse always wins, and a gesture that curls your index finger may click instead of firing." = "点击和滚动期间匹配照常进行；一旦识别到手势并处于保持期，手指下压不再点击。识别前落下的下压仍会点击——给手势设置保持时间即可覆盖其余情况。关闭时鼠标始终优先：卷曲食指的手势可能先点击而不是触发。";
"Mouse control is off: you chose “custom gestures only” under Settings → Tracking. Your hands never move the cursor — they only trigger the gestures below (and the stop-tracking wave)." = "鼠标控制已关闭：你在设置 → 追踪里选择了“仅自定义手势”。手不会移动光标，只触发下方绑定的手势（以及停止追踪挥动）。";
"EVERYTHING after the wake word goes to the agent, asked to perform it via computer use. Slower than on-device and far more capable; the run streams in the corner panel and the outcome flashes in the top-of-screen capsule." = "唤醒词之后的一切都交给代理，让它通过计算机操作执行。比设备端慢，但能力强得多；执行过程在角落面板实时展示，结果在屏幕顶部胶囊闪现，代理决定做的任何事都会直接执行，不会事先询问。";
"A two-minute practice round: take control, move, click, drag, scroll and right-click against live targets, with the tracker's live view of your hand telling you what it sees. It opens on its own once, right after the welcome tour — this is how to run it again, and each lesson can be skipped." = "两分钟练习：对着真实目标完成接管、移动、点击、拖拽、滚动和右键，追踪器的实时画面会告诉你它看到了什么。练习只自动打开一次，这里是再次运行它的入口，每一课都可以跳过。";
"Pawvis operates this Mac. It moves the real cursor and posts real clicks, drags and scrolls on your behalf, so a stray gesture can click whatever is under the pointer. With voice control on it can also open apps, type and press keys, and with the optional agent hand-off enabled it can carry out whatever the agent decides to do, without asking first." = "Pawvis 会操作这台 Mac。它替你移动真实光标并发出真实的点击、拖拽和滚动，一个走神的手势就可能点到光标下的任何东西。开启语音控制后它还能打开应用、输入和运行命令：听错的句子同样会被执行，代理模式更会不经询问直接执行。";
"Pawvis is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Its developer accepts no liability for any action taken with it, intentional or not, or for any resulting loss or damage. You are responsible for what happens on your machine: please use it responsibly, and keep the menu bar toggle in reach." = "Pawvis 按现状提供，不附带任何形式的保证。开发者对使用它产生的任何行为（无论是否有意）以及由此造成的任何损失不承担责任。你的机器上发生的一切由你负责。";
"Any camera macOS can see works, your iPhone included: when it's nearby as a Continuity Camera it appears in the picker in Settings → General, one pick away. It uses the iPhone's rear lenses, so point the back of the phone at you. Pawvis never switches cameras on its own." = "macOS 能看到的摄像头都可以用，包括 iPhone：作为连续互通相机在附近时，它会出现在设置 → 通用的选择器里，一键即选。它使用 iPhone 的后置镜头，请把手机背面对准你。";
"Next comes a two-minute practice round that teaches the moves against live targets; skip it any time. Pawvis lives in the menu bar: click the claw to stop or start tracking, or open Settings, where this tour and the practice round can be run again." = "接下来是一轮两分钟的练习，对着真实目标学会这些操作，可随时跳过。Pawvis 常驻菜单栏：点小爪可停止或开始追踪，或打开设置——导览和练习都从那里进入。";

